Ngayon nasa prompt ka:
do you wish to change the configuration? y/n [n]:
type: n
then proceed to step 6

## 6. Reset the Router

At the ROMMON prompt:

    reset

Press Enter.

Do NOT press BREAK again.

Allow the router to boot normally.

`0x2142` causes the router to bypass the existing startup configuration during this boot.

## 7. Enter IOS Without the Old Password

After booting:

    Router>

Enter:

    enable

Expected:

    Router#

The old enable password should not be required because the startup configuration was bypassed.

## 8. VERIFY BEFORE ERASING

Before performing the actual configuration wipe, check the router.

### Check Configuration Register

    show version

Look for:

    Configuration register is 0x2142

### Check Bootflash

    dir bootflash:

Verify:

    isr4300-universalk9.16.08.01.SPA.bin

Do not delete this file.

### Check Running Configuration

    show running-config

The running configuration may contain the previous configuration.

DO NOT save it.

Do NOT run:

    copy running-config startup-config

or:

    write memory

### Check Startup Configuration

    show startup-config

This allows you to verify the existing startup configuration.

## 9. Erase the Existing Configuration

If the goal is to completely remove the old configuration:

    erase startup-config

When prompted:

    Erasing the nvram filesystem will remove all configuration files!
    Continue? [confirm]

Press:

    Enter

IMPORTANT:

If `erase startup-config` reports an NVRAM error, STOP.

Do not randomly format or delete storage files.

## 10. Restore the Normal Configuration Register

After successfully clearing the startup configuration:

    configure terminal

Then:

    config-register 0x2102

Exit configuration mode:

    end

Verify:

    show version

Expected:

    Configuration register is 0x2102

`0x2102` is the normal boot configuration.

## 11. Reload the Router

Run:

    reload

If prompted:

    System configuration has been modified. Save? [yes/no]:

Answer:

    no

Do not save the previous running configuration.

## 12. Initial Configuration Dialog

After reboot, the router may display:

    --- System Configuration Dialog ---

    Would you like to enter the initial configuration dialog? [yes/no]:

For a clean lab router:

    no

Press Enter.

You should get:

    Router>

Then:

    enable

Expected:

    Router#

The old enable password should no longer exist.

## 13. Final Verification

Check the configuration register:

    show version

Expected:

    Configuration register is 0x2102

Check the running configuration:

    show running-config

The configuration should now be minimal/default.

Check the startup configuration:

    show startup-config

The previous configuration should no longer be present.

Check the IOS image:

    dir bootflash:

Verify that the IOS image remains:

    isr4300-universalk9.16.08.01.SPA.bin

# ROMMON Command Reference

Display ROMMON variables:

    set

Display bootflash contents:

    dir bootflash:

Display configuration register:

    confreg

Ignore startup configuration on next boot:

    confreg 0x2142

Normal boot configuration:

    confreg 0x2102

Restart router from ROMMON:

    reset

# Configuration Register Reference

| Register | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `0x2142` | Ignore startup configuration during boot / password recovery |
| `0x2102` | Normal boot |

